From: ojiepermana <me@ojiepermana.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 09:32:09 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(platform-macos): spec 0015 step 5,
 MacosBackgroundAgent on SMAppService

Add MacosBackgroundAgent: status, register, unregister, and relaunch through SMAppService.agent on objc2-service-management, each inside an autorelease pool, with every unsafe block commented. Before any SMAppService call it checks that NSBundle.mainBundle is the Stackly app and holds the LaunchAgent plist and stacklyd, so a cargo build or test answers NotBundled or HelperMissing without asking the OS. NSError codes map by SDK symbol to AgentOsErrorKind. MacosPlatform installs it and the background_agent capability reports supported. Tests never register: they cover the status and error maps, the helper check, and every call from outside a bundle.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
